> I found a Hawaiian shirt on my way back up, so I'll keep hold of and
> enchant that. Is there any way of writing blessed enchant armor without
> any holy water? Bloody elven helms were ALL +0.

Write on blessed scrolls with an uncursed marker or write on
uncursed/blessed scrolls w/ a blessed marker.

It's not unusual to find some blessed scrolls of blank paper at
random.

If you have blessed ?remove curse, read it while confused to randomly
bless/curse/uncurse items in inventory.  So lock yourself in a closet,
drop everything but a bunch of water, #name all the water individually
into different slots in inventory, confuse self, read b?remove curse.

Once you have one holy water, use it to make tons more.  If you use the
remove curse trick, you get some unholy water too (bonus that's usually
harder to come by).

